    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Galactic Plague 2000</strong> is a shoot 'em up that blends classic arcade gameplay with modern roguelite elements. Experience the action your way with two distinct visual modes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro Mode</strong> \u2013 A love letter to the old-school era, featuring filters and effects that recreate the iconic arcade aesthetics of the '80s.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635080/extras/1fc0a3da72f5b99e673c2b452193aa9b.poster.webp?t=1754307374\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635080/extras/1fc0a3da72f5b99e673c2b452193aa9b.webp?t=1754307374\" class=\"bb_img\" width=542 height=304 /></picture></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Normal Mode</strong> \u2013 A crisp, filter-free presentation for those who prefer a more modern look.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635080/extras/1a1718cdd279bccde547e6768a6c05a0.poster.webp?t=1754307374\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635080/extras/1a1718cdd279bccde547e6768a6c05a0.webp?t=1754307374\" class=\"bb_img\" width=580 height=326 /></picture></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Cosmic Battle for Survival</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Story Mode</strong>, you take on the role of Jack, a young boy who stumbles upon a mysterious arcade machine in an abandoned game center\u2014only to be pulled into an intergalactic war. To save the galaxy, he must pilot a powerful starfighter and recover the <strong>nine magic cubes</strong> stolen by the invading Martians.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635080/extras/6b63b6f7706eaca871289c4825bab02c.poster.avif?t=1754307374\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635080/extras/6b63b6f7706eaca871289c4825bab02c.webm?t=1754307374\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635080/extras/6b63b6f7706eaca871289c4825bab02c.mp4?t=1754307374\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each playthrough is a high-stakes challenge where you'll upgrade your ship, unlock legendary weapons, and battle relentless enemies across <strong>nine unique worlds</strong>. Can you stop the plague before it's too late?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story Mode</strong> \u2013 Conquer <strong>nine worlds</strong>, each with <strong>14 action-packed stages</strong> and an <strong>epic boss fight</strong> at the end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635080/extras/f04db49352f1219ccbc045b0493bbcae.avif?t=1754307374\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Arcade Mode</i></strong> (Extreme Survival): Test your skills in the ultimate challenge and compete to be the best player in the world on the global leaderboards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade and achievement system to enhance your ship and skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 30 types of enemies and more than 20 final bosses that will test your skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different weapon configurations with 9 weapons and 10 special abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635080/extras/1ddccdbe927aef83445e3c5409057802.avif?t=1754307374\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It also features 3 extra challenges, which are unlocked as you progress through the game. Each challenge has 14 levels plus the final enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635080/extras/cf6343e2c53135cb4eeb99aa0513edf8.avif?t=1754307374\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A dynamic sci-fi soundtrack</strong> blending <strong>16-bit retro vibes</strong> with cyberpunk and cinematic influences\u2014immersing you in an epic space adventure worthy of a classic anime.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Galactic Plague 2000</strong> is a shoot 'em up that blends classic arcade gameplay with modern roguelite elements. Experience the action your way with two distinct visual modes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro Mode</strong> \u2013 A love letter to the old-school era, featuring filters and effects that recreate the iconic arcade aesthetics of the '80s.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635080/extras/1fc0a3da72f5b99e673c2b452193aa9b.poster.webp?t=1754307374\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635080/extras/1fc0a3da72f5b99e673c2b452193aa9b.webp?t=1754307374\" class=\"bb_img\" width=542 height=304 /></picture></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Normal Mode</strong> \u2013 A crisp, filter-free presentation for those who prefer a more modern look.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635080/extras/1a1718cdd279bccde547e6768a6c05a0.poster.webp?t=1754307374\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635080/extras/1a1718cdd279bccde547e6768a6c05a0.webp?t=1754307374\" class=\"bb_img\" width=580 height=326 /></picture></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Cosmic Battle for Survival</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Story Mode</strong>, you take on the role of Jack, a young boy who stumbles upon a mysterious arcade machine in an abandoned game center\u2014only to be pulled into an intergalactic war. To save the galaxy, he must pilot a powerful starfighter and recover the <strong>nine magic cubes</strong> stolen by the invading Martians.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635080/extras/6b63b6f7706eaca871289c4825bab02c.poster.avif?t=1754307374\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635080/extras/6b63b6f7706eaca871289c4825bab02c.webm?t=1754307374\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635080/extras/6b63b6f7706eaca871289c4825bab02c.mp4?t=1754307374\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each playthrough is a high-stakes challenge where you'll upgrade your ship, unlock legendary weapons, and battle relentless enemies across <strong>nine unique worlds</strong>. Can you stop the plague before it's too late?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story Mode</strong> \u2013 Conquer <strong>nine worlds</strong>, each with <strong>14 action-packed stages</strong> and an <strong>epic boss fight</strong> at the end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635080/extras/f04db49352f1219ccbc045b0493bbcae.avif?t=1754307374\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Arcade Mode</i></strong> (Extreme Survival): Test your skills in the ultimate challenge and compete to be the best player in the world on the global leaderboards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade and achievement system to enhance your ship and skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 30 types of enemies and more than 20 final bosses that will test your skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different weapon configurations with 9 weapons and 10 special abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635080/extras/1ddccdbe927aef83445e3c5409057802.avif?t=1754307374\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It also features 3 extra challenges, which are unlocked as you progress through the game. Each challenge has 14 levels plus the final enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635080/extras/cf6343e2c53135cb4eeb99aa0513edf8.avif?t=1754307374\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A dynamic sci-fi soundtrack</strong> blending <strong>16-bit retro vibes</strong> with cyberpunk and cinematic influences\u2014immersing you in an epic space adventure worthy of a classic anime.</p></li></ul>",
